  'This venue is booked by night or by show, so the day has no hourly grid. See the Bookings section.': 'Bu yerda tunlar yoki seanslar bo‘yicha bron qilinadi, shuning uchun soatlik jadval yo‘q. «Bronlar» bo‘limiga qarang.',
