  'Neighbourhood Italian with a wood-fired kitchen and a terrace over the canal. Handmade pasta, short seasonal menu, natural wines.': 'O‘tin pechli va kanal ustidagi ayvonli italyan restorani. Qo‘lda tayyorlangan pasta, qisqa mavsumiy menyu, tabiiy vinolar.',
  'Family trattoria with long tables, a wood oven and a short list of house wines.': 'Uzun stollar, o‘tin pechi va uy vinolarining qisqa ro‘yxati bilan oilaviy trattoriya.',
  'Counter seating around an open sushi bar and a small dining room for groups.': 'Ochiq sushi-bar atrofida o‘rindiqlar va guruhlar uchun kichik zal.',
  'Large courtyard restaurant known for plov from the kazan, tandoor bread and weekend banquets.': 'Qozon palovi, tandir noni va dam olish kunlaridagi ziyofatlari bilan mashhur hovlili restoran.',
  'Casual bistro with modern takes on Uzbek classics and a quick lunch menu.': 'O‘zbek klassikasining zamonaviy talqini va tezkor tushlik menyusi bilan oddiy bistro.',
  'Specialty coffee, all-day breakfast and a quiet back room for working.': 'Maxsus qahva, kun bo‘yi nonushta va ishlash uchun sokin xona.',
  'Classic barbershop with four chairs. Scissor cuts, fades and hot towel shaves by appointment.': 'To‘rt o‘rindiqli klassik sartaroshxona. Qaychi bilan soch olish, feyd va issiq sochiq bilan soqol olish — yozilish bo‘yicha.',
  'Colour, cuts and styling in a small studio with two stylists.': 'Ikki stilistli kichik studiyada bo‘yash, soch olish va turmaklash.',
  'Day spa with massage rooms, a hammam and a quiet lounge. Treatments by certified therapists.': 'Massaj xonalari, hammom va sokin dam olish zonasi bilan spa. Muolajalarni sertifikatlangan mutaxassislar o‘tkazadi.',
  'General and cosmetic dentistry. First visit includes an examination and a treatment plan.': 'Umumiy va estetik stomatologiya. Birinchi tashrifda ko‘rik va davolash rejasi.',
  'Business hotel a short walk from the old town, with a rooftop breakfast room and a small gym.': 'Eski shahar yaqinidagi biznes-mehmonxona: tomda nonushta va kichik sport zali.',
  'Four tennis courts by the canal, three indoors. Racket rental and showers on site.': 'Kanal bo‘yida to‘rtta tennis korti, uchtasi yopiq. Raketka ijarasi va dush bor.',
  'Boutique studio with yoga, pilates and strength rooms you can book by the hour.': 'Soatlab bron qilinadigan yoga, pilates va kuch mashg‘ulotlari zallari bilan butik-studiya.',
  'Open-plan coworking with hot desks and two meeting rooms. Coffee and fast Wi-Fi included.': 'Erkin ish joylari va ikkita uchrashuv xonasi bilan ochiq kovorking. Qahva va tez Wi-Fi kiritilgan.',
  'A weekly jazz night with a resident quartet and guest soloists. Standing floor, a few seated rows and VIP tables.': 'Doimiy kvartet va mehmon solistlar bilan haftalik jaz kechasi. Tik turish joylari, bir necha qator o‘rindiqlar va VIP stollar.',
  'Free cancellation up to 2 hours before. Tables held for 15 minutes. Groups of 8+ need the restaurant to confirm.': '2 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish. Stol 15 daqiqa kutiladi. 8 kishidan ortiq guruhlarni restoran tasdiqlaydi.',
  'Free cancellation up to 1 hour before. Tables held for 10 minutes.': '1 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish. Stol 10 daqiqa kutiladi.',
  'Free cancellation up to 2 hours before. Please arrive 5 minutes early.': '2 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish. Iltimos, 5 daqiqa oldin keling.',
  'Free cancellation up to 2 hours before.': '2 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.', 'Free cancellation up to 4 hours before.': '4 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.',
  'Free cancellation up to 24 hours before.': '24 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.', 'Free cancellation up to 6 hours before.': '6 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.',
  'Free cancellation up to 3 hours before.': '3 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.',
  'Check-in from 14:00, check-out until 12:00. Flexible rate: free cancellation up to 48 hours before check-in.': 'Kirish 14:00 dan, chiqish 12:00 gacha. Moslashuvchan tarif: kirishdan 48 soat oldingacha bepul bekor qilish.',
  'Tickets can be cancelled free of charge up to 24 hours before the show. Payment is taken at the door.': 'Chiptalarni boshlanishdan 24 soat oldingacha bepul qaytarish mumkin. To‘lov kirishda.',

